<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on UK engineering growth basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on UK engineering growth basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on a UK engineering growth basket comprising Siebe Plc, TI Group Plc, Smiths Industries Plc, Johnson Matthey Plc, Morgan Crucible Co Plc, Powerscreen International Plc, Cobham Plc, Halma Plc and Spirax-Sarco Plc, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    144.25 GBP		ISSUE PRICE  1.585 GBP</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	04.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  144.25 GBP</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
